{"id":"4d7b1b6f9345e344","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-logic-as-adjoint.md","title":"thm-logic-as-adjoints","display":"thm-logic-as-adjoints","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-logic-as-adjoint","aliases":["16-thm-logic-as-adjoint","16-thm--logic-as-adjoint"],"display":"thm-logic-as-adjoints","depends_on":["[[16-df-logic-fibration]]","[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]","[[16-df-eq-functor]]","[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]","[[16-thm-product-sum-adjoint]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"source":"Definition 4.2.1 p.233 (PDF253); Definition 3.4.1 pp.190–191 (PDF210–211); Definition 10.4.7 p.616 (PDF636)","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-logic-as-adjoint"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-logic-as-adjoint</span><span>16-thm--logic-as-adjoint</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-logic-as-adjoints"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"45918fba7ae3214d\" href=\"?note=45918fba7ae3214d\" title=\"16-df-logic-fibration\">16-df-logic-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" href=\"?note=7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-with-unit\">16-df-comprehension-with-unit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae1a27a060629395\" href=\"?note=ae1a27a060629395\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts\">16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b662179811b5cc72\" href=\"?note=b662179811b5cc72\" title=\"16-thm-product-sum-adjoint\">16-thm-product-sum-adjoint</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 4.2.1 p.233 (PDF253); Definition 3.4.1 pp.190–191 (PDF210–211); Definition 10.4.7 p.616 (PDF636)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicFib}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicFib}(p)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"45918fba7ae3214d\" href=\"?note=45918fba7ae3214d\" title=\"16-df-logic-fibration\">16-df-logic-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" href=\"?note=7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-with-unit\">16-df-comprehension-with-unit</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi\">\\(C=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi\\)</span>，取后一结构同一见证中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(T:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 和余单位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon:TC\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\epsilon:TC\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(I)\">\\(T(I)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_I\">\\(\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 的终对象。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I\">\\(\\pi=\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\pi,\\Pi_\\pi\">\\(\\Sigma_\\pi,\\Pi_\\pi\\)</span> 取所选一般量词伴随，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_I\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_I\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_{1,I}\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_{1,I}\\)</span> 并经单位积同构运输，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_I=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle:I\\to I\\times I\">\\(\\delta_I=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle:I\\to I\\times I\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_I\\times\\mathcal E_I\">\\(\\mathcal E_I\\times\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b662179811b5cc72\" href=\"?note=b662179811b5cc72\" title=\"16-thm-product-sum-adjoint\">16-thm-product-sum-adjoint</a> 的六元组积范畴。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_I,\\sqcup_I,\\sqcap_I\">\\(\\Delta_I,\\sqcup_I,\\sqcap_I\\)</span> 的两个分量由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,X&#39;,Y&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X,Y,X&#39;,Y&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to X&#39;,g:Y\\to Y&#39;\">\\(f:X\\to X&#39;,g:Y\\to Y&#39;\\)</span> 为垂直箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\vee_IY,X\\wedge_IY\">\\(X\\vee_IY,X\\wedge_IY\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ae1a27a060629395\" href=\"?note=ae1a27a060629395\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts\">16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a> 的同一选择；预序性保证末两项单元素集合的唯一性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dashv_\\epsilon\">\\(\\dashv_\\epsilon\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Delta_I(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(X,X),\\qquad\\Delta_I(f)\\coloneqq(f,f),\\\\\n\\sqcup_I(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq X\\vee_IY,\\qquad\n\\{\\sqcup_I(f,g)\\}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X\\vee_IY,X&#39;\\vee_IY&#39;),\\\\\n\\sqcap_I(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq X\\wedge_IY,\\qquad\n\\{\\sqcap_I(f,g)\\}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X\\wedge_IY,X&#39;\\wedge_IY&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Delta_I(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(X,X),\\qquad\\Delta_I(f)\\coloneqq(f,f),\\\\\n\\sqcup_I(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq X\\vee_IY,\\qquad\n\\{\\sqcup_I(f,g)\\}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X\\vee_IY,X&#39;\\vee_IY&#39;),\\\\\n\\sqcap_I(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq X\\wedge_IY,\\qquad\n\\{\\sqcap_I(f,g)\\}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X\\wedge_IY,X&#39;\\wedge_IY&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\Sigma_\\pi\\dashv\\pi^*\\dashv\\Pi_\\pi,\\\\\n&amp;\\sqcup_I\\dashv\\Delta_I\\dashv\\sqcap_I,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf{Eq}_I\\dashv\\delta_I^*,\\\\\n&amp;T\\dashv_{\\epsilon}C.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\Sigma_\\pi\\dashv\\pi^*\\dashv\\Pi_\\pi,\\\\\n&amp;\\sqcup_I\\dashv\\Delta_I\\dashv\\sqcap_I,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf{Eq}_I\\dashv\\delta_I^*,\\\\\n&amp;T\\dashv_{\\epsilon}C.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前三行分别由量词、纤维余积/积和简单等式的泛性质得到。例如在纤维预序中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\vee_IY\\le_I Z\">\\(X\\vee_IY\\le_I Z\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\le_I Z\">\\(X\\le_I Z\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\le_I Z\">\\(Y\\le_I Z\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\le_I X\\wedge_IY\">\\(Z\\le_I X\\wedge_IY\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\le_I X\">\\(Z\\le_I X\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\le_I Y\">\\(Z\\le_I Y\\)</span>，正是对角函子两侧的 Hom 对应。等式行经单位积的规范同构运输 Definition 3.4.1 的伴随，源靶分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_I\">\\(\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>最后一行使用 Definition 10.4.7 中带单位理解结构的实际见证。仅有理解函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span> 及其笛卡尔性，不能推出终对象函子有右伴随；原稿的无来源 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(p)\\)</span> 因而不足以支撑这一步。这里以本书已有的精确结构假设修正，并固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi,T,\\epsilon\">\\(\\chi,T,\\epsilon\\)</span>，不把存在量词中的任意见证作为游离常元。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-logic-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"45918fba7ae3214d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-logic-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-with-unit","status":"resolved","id":"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-3","targetAncho